<?xml version="1.0"?><iai friendlyname="Digestive System Game" id="001707fc" height="400" width="556" hasaudio="0" hascredits="0" lang="E" basecontroltype="DragDrop" outlinecolorid="1" skinstyle="Standard" skinlib="standard"><slides><slide type="dragdrop" sequence="1" slideid="1"><standardslide><toptext textstyleid="1"><text>&lt;html&gt;Coloca cada palabra en el lugar que le corresponde.&lt;/html&gt;</text></toptext><image>001707fc.swf</image><bgimage>DDGv_standard_bg.swf</bgimage><imagerefid/><items><item id="0" seq="1" zindex="1" sequence="1"><image inbucketwidth="31" inbucketheight="16" onstagewidth="31" onstageheight="16" popwidth="31" popheight="16" onstagex="284" onstagey="56" baseheight="16" basewidth="31" pctstage="100.1" pctpop="100.1" pctbucket="100">Boca.swf</image><hotarea><point><x>282</x><y>55</y></point><point><x>331</x><y>54</y></point><point><x>331</x><y>77</y></point><point><x>283</x><y>75</y></point><point><x>282</x><y>55</y></point></hotarea><tooltext/><solvedtooltext>En la boca se trocean  los alimentos y se mezclan con la saliva.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid/><altitems/></item><item id="1" seq="1" zindex="2" sequence="2"><image inbucketwidth="62" inbucketheight="16" onstagewidth="62" onstageheight="16" popwidth="62" popheight="16" onstagex="284" onstagey="176" baseheight="16" basewidth="62" pctstage="100.1" pctpop="100.1" pctbucket="100.1">Estomago.swf</image><hotarea><point><x>284</x><y>173</y></point><point><x>377</x><y>171</y></point><point><x>375</x><y>195</y></point><point><x>284</x><y>196</y></point><point><x>284</x><y>173</y></point></hotarea><tooltext/><solvedtooltext>El estómago es como una “batidora” dónde los alimentos se mezclan con los jugos gástricos y se  convierten en una papilla llamada quimo.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid/><altitems/></item><item id="2" seq="1" zindex="3" sequence="3"><image inbucketwidth="50" inbucketheight="16" onstagewidth="50" onstageheight="16" popwidth="50" popheight="16" onstagex="75" onstagey="91" baseheight="16" basewidth="50" pctstage="100.1" pctpop="100.1" pctbucket="100.1">Esofago.swf</image><hotarea><point><x>57</x><y>82</y></point><point><x>131</x><y>85</y></point><point><x>132</x><y>110</y></point><point><x>56</x><y>110</y></point><point><x>56</x><y>83</y></point><point><x>57</x><y>82</y></point></hotarea><tooltext/><solvedtooltext>El esófago es un tubo que comunica la boca con el estómago.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid/><altitems/></item><item id="3" seq="1" zindex="4" sequence="4"><image inbucketwidth="45" inbucketheight="16" onstagewidth="45" onstageheight="16" popwidth="45" popheight="16" onstagex="78" onstagey="139" baseheight="16" basewidth="45" pctstage="100.1" pctpop="100.1" pctbucket="100.1">Higado.swf</image><hotarea><point><x>53</x><y>136</y></point><point><x>128</x><y>134</y></point><point><x>127</x><y>159</y></point><point><x>56</x><y>159</y></point><point><x>53</x><y>136</y></point></hotarea><tooltext/><solvedtooltext>El hígado es muy grande. En él se fabrica la bilis.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid/><altitems/></item><item id="4" seq="1" zindex="5" sequence="5"><image inbucketwidth="114" inbucketheight="15" onstagewidth="116" onstageheight="16" popwidth="116" popheight="16" onstagex="282" onstagey="275" baseheight="16" basewidth="116" pctstage="100" pctpop="100.1" pctbucket="99">Intestino delgado.swf</image><hotarea><point><x>282</x><y>270</y></point><point><x>411</x><y>272</y></point><point><x>411</x><y>294</y></point><point><x>283</x><y>297</y></point><point><x>282</x><y>270</y></point></hotarea><tooltext/><solvedtooltext>En el intestino delgado los nutrientes obtenidos tras la digestión de los alimentos pasan a los vasos sanguíneos.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid/><altitems/></item><item id="5" seq="1" zindex="6" sequence="6"><image inbucketwidth="107" inbucketheight="16" onstagewidth="107" onstageheight="16" popwidth="107" popheight="16" onstagex="16" onstagey="285" baseheight="16" basewidth="107" pctstage="100.1" pctpop="100.1" pctbucket="100">Intestino grueso.swf</image><hotarea><point><x>1</x><y>282</y></point><point><x>3</x><y>281</y></point><point><x>128</x><y>284</y></point><point><x>129</x><y>308</y></point><point><x>1</x><y>306</y></point><point><x>1</x><y>282</y></point></hotarea><tooltext/><solvedtooltext>Al intestino grueso llegan los residuos de la digestión de los alimentos. Se forman las heces que salen al exterior.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid/><altitems/></item><item id="6" seq="1" zindex="7" sequence="7"><image inbucketwidth="59" inbucketheight="16" onstagewidth="59" onstageheight="16" popwidth="59" popheight="16" onstagex="284" onstagey="218" baseheight="16" basewidth="59" pctstage="100.1" pctpop="100.1" pctbucket="100.1">Pancreas.swf</image><hotarea><point><x>282</x><y>213</y></point><point><x>384</x><y>216</y></point><point><x>384</x><y>242</y></point><point><x>281</x><y>239</y></point><point><x>281</x><y>214</y></point><point><x>282</x><y>213</y></point></hotarea><tooltext/><solvedtooltext>El páncreas produce el jugo pancreático que pasa al intestino delgado y ayuda a digerir los alimentos.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid/><altitems/></item><item id="7" seq="1" zindex="8" sequence="8"><image inbucketwidth="93" inbucketheight="16" onstagewidth="93" onstageheight="16" popwidth="93" popheight="16" onstagex="29" onstagey="223" baseheight="16" basewidth="93" pctstage="100.1" pctpop="100.1" pctbucket="100.1">Vesicula biliar.swf</image><hotarea><point><x>16</x><y>216</y></point><point><x>126</x><y>216</y></point><point><x>126</x><y>245</y></point><point><x>18</x><y>245</y></point><point><x>16</x><y>216</y></point></hotarea><tooltext/><solvedtooltext>En la vesícula biliar se almacena la bilis que pasa al intestino delgado y ayuda a digerir los alimentos.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid/><altitems/></item></items><bgimagerefid/><rewards><reward><text textstyleid="2">&lt;html&gt;¡Enhorabuena, excelente puntuación!&lt;/html&gt;</text><imagefile>baserew1.swf</imagefile></reward><reward><text textstyleid="2">&lt;html&gt;Lo has hecho muy bien. ¿Quieres jugar de nuevo?&lt;/html&gt;</text><imagefile>baserew2.swf</imagefile></reward><reward><text textstyleid="2">&lt;html&gt;Seguro que puedes hacerlo mejor. ¿Quieres intentarlo de nuevo?&lt;/html&gt;</text><imagefile>baserew3.swf</imagefile></reward></rewards></standardslide></slide></slides><iaigame bucketdirection="vertical" bucketposx="0" bucketposy="36" stagewidth="414" stageheight="330" bucketwidth="126" bucketheight="330"><resetbuttontext textbuttonstyleid="1">&lt;html&gt;Nuevo intento&lt;/html&gt;</resetbuttontext><scorelabeltext textstyleid="3">&lt;html&gt;Puntuación:&lt;/html&gt;</scorelabeltext><matcheslabeltext textstyleid="4">&lt;html&gt;aciertos&lt;/html&gt;</matcheslabeltext><trieslabeltext textstyleid="4">&lt;html&gt;intentos&lt;/html&gt;</trieslabeltext></iaigame><textstyles><textstyle size="16" font="Trebuchet MS" bold="1" italic="0" underline="0" colorid="2" align="left" id="1"/><textstyle size="20" font="Trebuchet MS" bold="1" italic="0" underline="0" colorid="2" align="center" id="2"/><textstyle size="16" font="Trebuchet MS" bold="1" italic="1" underline="0" colorid="1" align="left" id="3"/><textstyle size="12" font="Trebuchet MS" bold="1" italic="1" underline="0" colorid="1" align="left" id="4"/><textstyle size="13" font="Trebuchet MS" bold="1" italic="0" underline="0" colorid="3" align="center" id="5"/><textstyle size="13" font="Trebuchet MS" bold="1" italic="0" underline="0" colorid="4" align="center" id="6"/><textstyle size="20" font="Trebuchet MS" bold="0" italic="0" underline="0" colorid="5" align="left" id="7"/><textstyle size="11" font="Trebuchet MS" bold="0" italic="0" underline="0" colorid="5" align="left" id="8"/></textstyles><textbuttonstyles><textbuttonstyle showbg="0" showoutline="0" basestyleid="5" rollstyleid="5" downstyleid="5" selectedstyleid="5" disabledstyleid="6" basestateid="1" rollstateid="1" downstateid="1" selectedstateid="1" disabledstateid="2" id="1"/></textbuttonstyles><creditsdialogdata bodystyleid="8" titlestyleid="7"><dialogtitle>&lt;html&gt;Créditos&lt;/html&gt;</dialogtitle><text/></creditsdialogdata><colors><color r="137" g="51" b="204" id="1"/><color r="50" g="50" b="50" id="2"/><color r="255" g="255" b="255" id="3"/><color r="228" g="194" b="255" id="4"/><color r="0" g="0" b="0" id="5"/></colors><twocolorbuttonstates><tcbuttonstate outlinecolorid="3" bgcolorid="3" graphiccolorid="3" id="1"/><tcbuttonstate outlinecolorid="3" bgcolorid="3" graphiccolorid="4" id="2"/></twocolorbuttonstates><twocolorbuttonstyles/></iai>